Perhaps Rodney (and clones) should be generated with a high probability of 
carrying a wand of banishment, so just as you reach the stairs on level 1 
you suddenly find yourself back on level 40.

Another perhaps: it could be a scroll of banishment rather than a wand. 
That way you get fewer shots, it would banish everything within a certain 
range, if blessed that doesn't include the reader, if cursed it banishes 
only the reader, confused: sends the victims to to a dungeon branch that 
isn't Gehennom, cursed+confused sends you to a random branch of the dungeon 
(which could be a novel alternative way to find Vlad's tower).

Rodney & friends could usually be generated with one and be keen to use it 
on you although of course it might be cursed, or you might manage to 
confuse them first.


